From kirk@colinet.de Thu Feb 08 17:18:07 2001
Message-ID: <kirk-1010208171810.A0C7597@hydra.colinet.de>
Date: Thu, 08 Feb 2001 17:18:10 +0100
From: T. Weyergraf <kirk@colinet.de>
Subject: Re: Why use an Alpha
