exact probability (P): 1e-07

As soon as -fast was included, the value changed:

ccc -o crrtree -O3 -fast RRTree.c -lcpml -lffm -lm

ccc -o crrtree -O3 -fast -ieee RRTree.c -lcpml -lffm -lm

exact probability (P): 6.17021e-07

